# Development dependencies on top of the runtime ones.
#
#   pip-compile requirements-dev.in -o requirements-dev.txt
#
# The test suite is CPU-only and offline: it never downloads DINOv3 weights and never reads
# data/DroneVehicle (tests/flow_helpers.py builds a randomly initialized two-block backbone and a
# tiny aligned tree in tmp_path). So this needs nothing beyond the runtime set and a runner.

-r requirements.in

